<title>USA: Global DirectMail names acting CFO.</title>
<headline>Global DirectMail names acting CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PORT WASHINGTON, N.Y. 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp said Friday that Vice Chairman Bruce Leeds had been named acting chief financial officer, succeeding Kenneth Hall, who resigned as CFO.</p>
<p>It said Leeds continues as president of International Operations.</p>
<p>Global DirectMail Corp is a leading direct marketer of brand name and private label computer, office and industrial supplies.</p>
